  "description": "Pins protocol::prefs::parse_mcp_write_request — the canonical-JSON decoder for one entry of the mcp_write_requests array inside vault.prefs (external MCP write queue, myne-md/myne#923 task 13, decisions/ai/0752). A queued entry is a PROPOSAL, never a pending write: accepting one extends that connection's write grant by exactly the folder it names. parse_ok cases pin the decoded request as its canonical re-encoding (member order connection < folder < requested_at < summary < verb, summary omitted when empty) plus the exact consumed byte count; parse_reject cases pin the inputs a reader MUST refuse rather than read generously: an unknown member, a repeated member, and a request missing a required member.",
